54","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/102466#issuecomment-2637927054","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/102466","id":2637927054,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6dO5KO","user":{"login":"ydeltastar","id":133662278,"node_id":"U_kgDOB_eGRg","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/133662278?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar","html_url":"https://github.com/ydeltastar","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydeltastar/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-02-05T20:12:02Z","updated_at":"2025-02-05T20:42:09Z","body":"I also think it is weird that https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/100053 has anything to do with it but the issue disappears on any commit I checkout before it.\n\nI'm not using Arabic language and it occurs when disabling the advanced text server too (`module_text_server_adv_enabled=no module_text_server_fb_enabled=yes`).\n\nDowngrading the driver fixes the issue. Studio Driver 572.16 to the previous 566.36.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2637927054/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com